          "value": "<div class=\"fn\">\n<div style=\"font-size:0.9em;display:inline-block;\">Italian:  <div style=\"display:inline-block\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"it\"><i>Capriccio veneziano</i></div></div><br><div style=\"font-weight:bold;display:inline-block;\"><div style=\"display:inline-block\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><i>Venice – Small Square with Church and Canal – View of a Small Square in Venice</i></div></div><div style=\"display: none;\">title QS:P1476,it:\"Capriccio veneziano\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lit,\"Capriccio veneziano\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Len,\"Venice – Small Square with Church and Canal – View of a Small Square in Venice\"</div></div>",
